      "writtenOn": "2025-04-08T09:56:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And we are now at this point. Reindexing to update to Lucene 10, which is now on master, causes some of our caches to grow to 400+ GB and is terribly slow. Thus, we would like to again bring in this change. I have rebased it.",
      "parentUuid": "35f74c31_65ebb160",
      "revId": "a1b6101714681a74239bad5e15dd363eef6d3698",
