        "id": 3604707
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-09T19:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Previously large caches would slow down startup (bloomFilters) and pruning, where are you seeing the slowdowns now?",
      "parentUuid": "bfafd0bf_12f78d2c",
      "revId": "a1b6101714681a74239bad5e15dd363eef6d3698",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
